I'll announce the winner on an upcoming video,
and just before you float off, check out my

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.850
freaky facts and secrets about the making
of the new IT movie.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:34.139
Tap the screen here for that or more of my
movie deleted scenes videos.

00:10:34.139 --> 00:10:36.100
Thanks for watching and see you next time.

